5,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... hello. I think we should be careful about the building's limits.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. We should look at the actual data of what visitors want.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Rin,,I want to know who is actually doing all the hard work! Is everyone too busy?,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I'm excited! But we always have problems with things arriving late. I want to know why!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,A pleasure to be here. I suspect our budget has a habit of vanishing into thin air. I'd like to see where the money goes.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I'm not sure. Maybe we should check the structure?,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, that's a fair point. But the visitor's voice is often ignored.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, but if the people working are tired, the visitors will be sad too, right?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"Exactly! If the art isn't here, the visitors will be super grumpy!","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Such passion. While we chase ghosts and grumpy visitors, I shall focus on the invoices.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,pass,Daisuke,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
16,1,3,pass,Toshio,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I'm going to look at the staff and the volunteers! I bet it's a mess!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm going to check the paperwork and the shipping stuff! Let's find the mistake!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I shall examine the transport costs and the mount-making charges. Let's see where the leaks are.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,I'll... I'll check the structural survey and the maintenance log.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the visitor comment slips and the weekend head counts.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
