30,2,,status,Benjamin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
31,2,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
32,2,,status,Toshio,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
33,2,,status,Daisuke,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
34,2,,status,Rin,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
35,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... I found some things. The floor... it might not be strong enough for everything.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"Interesting. I've found that people don't come back for the ""perfect"" exhibition. They want interaction.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,Oh no! The lab is totally backed up! And the volunteers are just the history club!,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Kenji,,I found it! We keep missing the shipping cut-offs because the paperwork is too slow!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,How illuminating. It seems we spend a fortune on transport and custom mounts. We are essentially paying for the air around the art.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio... if we do an interactive one, will it be too heavy? I'm worried about the bay.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, that is a risk. But a static show is a failure in the eyes of the public.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,But who is going to set it up? The lab is full of old stuff and we have no real help!,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Kenji,,We just need to make sure the stuff actually gets here on time! That's the real problem!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"While you all argue over the ""how,"" I am wondering ""how much."" The transport costs are quite... exuberant.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,I just... I don't want the floor to break. Or the power to fail again.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Toshio,,We must prioritize the visitor's experience over the convenience of the staff.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,"@Toshio, that's not fair! If the staff are exhausted, they'll make mistakes! We need a simple show!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Kenji,,A simple show is great! As long as the shipping is easy and the paperwork is short!,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A ""simple"" show that doesn't require a fleet of expensive trucks or a small army of joiners sounds like a dream.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,Maybe... something light? And not too many powered things?,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Toshio,,"I will consider the candidates, but I will not vote for a boring one.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,I'm voting for whatever is easiest for the people working here!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I'm with Rin! Let's pick something that won't make us apologize at the door!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I shall vote for the option that doesn't treat the museum's budget like a bottomless well.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
