60,3,1,talk,Daisuke,,I... I think A is the safest. It's light and doesn't need the bay.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Toshio,,A and C both offer the interaction the public craves. B is too static.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Rin,,"C has a ""working bench""! That means the lab people have to work while people watch! No way!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Kenji,,A is local! That means no shipping cut-offs and no late deliveries! I love A!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,A is indeed quite elegant. Local loans mean minimal transport costs and likely fewer bespoke mounts.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Toshio, would A be too boring? I just... I really think D is too dangerous for the power.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Daisuke, A is not boring if the craftspeople are there. The data shows people return for the human element.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Rin,,"A is great! The craftspeople can help out, and it won't stress the staff too much!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Kenji,,"Yes! A is the winner! No trucks, no stress, no apologies!","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,It is rare that we all agree on something so quickly. It seems A is the only logical choice for our wallet and our sanity.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Daisuke,,I feel... a bit better now. I think A is a good choice.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I will support A. It satisfies the need for engagement without being an architectural nightmare.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Rin,,Yay! Let's do A! It's the kind of adventure I like—learning how things are made!,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm so happy! We're actually going to have the stuff ready on opening day!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,A rare moment of harmony. I shall cast my vote for the local textiles.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
